{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04488","headline":"于长史山池三日曲水宴 · 陈子昂","name":"于长史山池三日曲水宴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"摘兰藉芳月，祓宴坐廻汀。\n泛灩清流满，葳蕤白芷生。\n金弦挥赵瑟，玉指弄秦筝。\n岩榭风光媚，郊园春树平。\n烟花飞御道，罗绮照昆明。\n日落红尘合，车马乱纵横。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈子昂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04488.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04488","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}